  "details": "There are people who have irregularities in the cervical spine, with the result that their head has a constant tilt (to the right or to the left). When they wear a VR-helmet, the head of their avatar also has the same angle. I guess they would like the head of the avatar to be straight. For this I propose to add an adjustment of the avatar's head tilt with respect to the tilt of the VR-helmet.",
